# Vercel serves every uploaded file, so the repo's scripts, internal strategy
# docs and seomachine workspace were publicly reachable on the live site
# (e.g. /CLAUDE.md, /context/target-keywords.md, /output/*.md). Keep them out
# of the deployment. Site pages, assets, llms.txt/llms.md, robots.txt,
# sitemap.xml and rss.xml are unaffected.
*.py
__pycache__
/.claude
/.vscode
/CLAUDE.md
/README.md
/seo-machine-README.md
/seo-machine-QUICK-START.md
/data-sources-setup.md
/context
/data_sources
/config
/docs
/drafts
/examples
/output
/published
/research
/rewrites
/scratch
/topics
/wordpress
